***

## Update January 2026: Refinement Types Shipped!

We did it 🎉!

Both `OneOf` and `InclusiveRange` refinement types are live and have been for a while now. The design held up well; the "four L's" proved to be a solid foundation. If you want to see them in action,
check out the [Tour](/tour) (specifically the type system lesson).

